# PILOT-EXEC-01: real-acquired third-party source trees (django CMS, Saleor).
# These are materialized deterministically by scripts/pilot_repo_snapshot.py
# from the pinned repo cache at build time (fail-closed on SHA mismatch), so
# they are never committed. Manifests, pinned SHAs, validation commands,
# snapshot hashes, acquisition scripts, and evidence reports remain tracked.
# The embedded Todo source tree stays tracked (untouched).
benchmark_data/repositories/djangocms/
benchmark_data/repositories/saleor/

